<section id="bbs015" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>A single-series column chart under a takeaway title, values as plain numbers, with a source line as the caption.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="c7EVNR-5Tc"><h2>Repeat orders grew every month of the quarter</h2><graph height="290pt" width="860pt" text-size="md" y-axis-min="0" show-data-labels="true" chart-type="column"><properties><property type="label" label="Month" key="month"></property><property type="data" label="Repeat orders" key="repeat"></property></properties><data><row><cell>Jan</cell><cell>1240</cell></row><row><cell>Feb</cell><cell>1310</cell></row><row><cell>Mar</cell><cell>1385</cell></row><row><cell>Apr</cell><cell>1470</cell></row><row><cell>May</cell><cell>1590</cell></row><row><cell>Jun</cell><cell>1720</cell></row></data></graph><p font-size="sm">Source: order system, January to June 2026. Repeat orders are orders from accounts with a prior purchase in the last twelve months.</p></grid-item></grid></section>